opinion, it's one of the most important

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:41.520
traits to have. All right, trait six is

00:07:38.840 --> 00:07:43.840
that you have a high risk tolerance. So,

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:46.320
every financial guru online will tell

