00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:56.960
an unshakable belief and they bet on

00:08:54.839 --> 00:08:58.800
themselves and they know that that is

00:08:56.960 --> 00:09:00.360
the best possible outcome for them. So,

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:02.600
if you've ever looked at a big scary

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:05.120
