00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:55.760
is completely within your control. The

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:57.640
entrepreneurs who never break through

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:59.320
are almost always the ones who have an

00:09:57.640 --> 00:10:00.880
