00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:03.360
them, we've all met them, right? The

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:05.640
market was bad, the timing was wrong,

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:08.440
somebody screwed them over, right? And

00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:10.800
maybe some of that is even true, but it

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:12.720
doesn't matter because the moment that

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:15.120
you give away responsibility, you give

00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:17.080
away your power, right? Blame will

00:10:15.120 --> 00:10:20.000
actually end up keeping you stuck. But

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:22.040
ownership will move you forward. If your

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:23.760
default when something goes wrong is to

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:26.200
figure out what you could have done

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:28.360
